(Japanese: '''マッチャシティ''' ''Matcha City'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Kanto]]. Located between the {{safari|Kanto}} and [[Cinnabar Island]], it is the setting of the [[banned episodes|banned episode]] [[EP038]]. [[Dr. Akihabara]]'s laboratory is located in this city. This city was the site of the showdown between {{ashfr|Ash's group}} and {{TRT}} in the [[Pokémon Center]]'s computer, although [[Nurse Joy]] thought it was merely Team Rocket's computer virus that caused the ruckus.

